  "result": {
    "html": "<style>\n.sim-console{--bezel1:#1a1f1b;--bezel2:#0d110e;--panel:#0a150e;--panel2:#0c1c12;--edge:#2f6b3f;--edge2:#1d4227;--ink:#8ee39a;--ink-dim:#4f8f5e;--ink-bright:#c9ffd4;--amber:#e0b83a;--red:#e0554a;--blue:#58a6ff;--grn:#6fe08a;--lock-ring:15px;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;width:100%;height:100%;max-height:100%;overflow:hidden;padding:6px;background:radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 0%,#171c18 0%,#090c0a 70%);font-family:\"DejaVu Sans Mono\",\"Roboto Mono\",Consolas,monospace;color:var(--ink);font-size:11px;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:.02em;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\n.sim-console *{box-sizing:border-box}\n.sim-console .bezel{flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;padding:5px;border:2px solid #242a25;border-radius:7px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bezel1),var(--bezel2));box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #000,inset 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.8);overflow:hidden}\n.sim-console .screen{flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;padding:5px;border:1px solid var(--edge);border-radius:3px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#08120c,#050a07 60%,#07100b);box-shadow:inset 0 0 50px rgba(20,120,50,.10),inset 0 0 0 1px #0c2413;overflow:hidden}\n\n.sim-console .topbar{flex:0 0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(180px,1fr) auto minmax(160px,auto);gap:8px;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--edge2);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0d1d12,#091209);padding:1px 8px;border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden}\n.sim-console .brand{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;min-width:0}\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"system-name\"]{height:19px;min-width:160px;display:block;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.10em;color:var(--ink-bright);text-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(110,230,140,.35);overflow:hidden}\n.sim-console .brand .sub{font-size:8.5px;color:var(--ink-dim);letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.sim-console .statechips{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;flex-wrap:nowrap;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden}\n.sim-console .chip{border:1px solid var(--edge2);padding:1px 6px;font-size:8.5px;letter-spacing:.10em;color:var(--ink-dim);background:#08130c;border-radius:2px;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap}\n.sim-console .chip.on{color:var(--ink-bright);border-color:var(--edge);background:#0f2a18;box-shadow:inset 0 0 10px rgba(80,200,110,.18)}\n.sim-console .clockwrap{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:0}\n.sim-console .clockwrap .lab{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.15em;color:var(--ink-dim)}\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"clock\"]{height:22px;min-width:150px;display:block;padding:0 6px;border:1px solid var(--edge);background:#061009;font-size:15px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--amber);text-align:right;text-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(224,184,58,.3);overflow:hidden}\n\n/* ANCHORED LAYOUT: side columns are fixed px, the scope takes every remaining pixel.\n   Injected content (interception messages, long track lists) can never widen a column\n   or grow a row, so the radar port keeps its size. */\n.sim-console .main{flex:1 1 auto;min-height:0;display:grid;gap:4px;overflow:hidden;grid-template-columns:80px minmax(0,1fr) 292px 168px;grid-template-rows:minmax(0,1fr);grid-template-areas:\"rail scope picture res\"}\n.sim-console .rail{grid-area:rail;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;min-width:0;min-height:0;overflow:hidden}\n.sim-console .scope{grid-area:scope;min-width:0;min-height:0;overflow:hidden}\n.sim-console .picture{grid-area:picture;min-width:0;min-height:0;overflow:hidden}\n.sim-console .right{grid-area:res;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;min-width:0;min-height:0;overflow:hidden}\n\n.sim-console .panel{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;min-width:0;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--edge2);border-radius:2px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--panel2),var(--panel));box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}\n.sim-console .panel>.hd{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:6px;padding:1px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--edge2);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#123321,#0b1e12);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-bright);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden}\n.sim-console .panel>.hd .r{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--ink-dim);text-transform:none;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.sim-console .panel>.bd{flex:1 1 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;min-width:0;overflow:hidden;padding:3px}\n.sim-console .scope>.bd{padding:2px}\n\n.sim-console .kv{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:4px;font-size:8.5px;padding:0;border-bottom:1px dotted #14351f}\n.sim-console .kv:last-child{border-bottom:0}\n.sim-console .kv b{color:var(--ink-bright);font-weight:500;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}\n.sim-console .kv span{color:var(--ink-dim)}\n.sim-console .kv.warn b{color:var(--amber)}\n.sim-console .grouplab{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.10em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-dim);margin:3px 0 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--edge2)}\n.sim-console .grouplab:first-child{margin-top:0}\n\n/* range / scale control strip \\u2014 live control is rendered into the slot */\n.sim-console .rangebar{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;height:19px;padding:0 1px 1px;margin-bottom:1px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--edge2);font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.10em;color:var(--ink-dim);text-transform:uppercase;overflow:hidden}\n.sim-console .rangebar .zlab{white-space:nowrap}\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"range\"]{flex:1 1 auto;display:block;min-width:0;height:17px;overflow:hidden}\n\n.sim-console .scopewrap{position:relative;flex:1 1 auto;display:flex;align-items:stretch;justify-content:center;min-height:0;min-width:0;padding:0;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(72% 72% at 50% 92%,rgba(15,61,31,.55) 0%,rgba(4,10,6,.15) 100%)}\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"scope\"]{position:absolute;inset:0;display:block;min-height:0;min-width:0;overflow:hidden;cursor:grab;touch-action:none;overscroll-behavior:contain;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none}\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"scope\"]:active{cursor:grabbing}\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"scope\"] *{touch-action:none}\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"scope\"] svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}\n/* lock-on / selection marker: tight ring hugging the track symbol only */\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"scope\"] .lock-ring,.sim-console [data-slot=\"scope\"] .sel-ring,.sim-console [data-slot=\"scope\"] circle.lock,.sim-console [data-slot=\"scope\"] circle.selected{r:9px;fill:none;stroke:var(--amber);stroke-width:1.2;stroke-dasharray:3 3}\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"scope\"] div.lock-ring,.sim-console [data-slot=\"scope\"] div.sel-ring{width:var(--lock-ring);height:var(--lock-ring);margin:calc(var(--lock-ring) / -2) 0 0 calc(var(--lock-ring) / -2);border:1px dashed var(--amber);border-radius:50%;background:none}\n.sim-console .scopefoot{flex:0 0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:0 6px;height:12px;padding-top:1px;border-top:1px solid var(--edge2);font-size:8px;color:var(--ink-dim);letter-spacing:.04em;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden}\n\n/* TRACK READOUT: the injected table owns its own header row. Columns are sized for every\n   profile field plus the IFF code the runtime reports for each track; nothing here may\n   hide, collapse or clip that column. */\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"tracks\"]{flex:1 1 auto;display:block;min-height:0;min-width:0;padding:1px;overflow:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;font-size:9px;line-height:1.2;background:repeating-linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(30,90,50,.07) 0 18px,transparent 18px 36px)}\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"tracks\"] table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:auto;font-size:9px}\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"tracks\"] th,.sim-console [data-slot=\"tracks\"] td{padding:1px 2px;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;text-align:left;overflow:visible;text-overflow:clip}\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"tracks\"] th{font-size:7.5px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-dim);border-bottom:1px solid var(--edge2);position:sticky;top:0;background:#0b1e12;z-index:1}\n/* IFF code cell: force it visible whatever markup the runtime uses, and never let it be\n   the column that gets squeezed away. Empty IFF reads as a dash, not as blank space. */\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"tracks\"] .iff,.sim-console [data-slot=\"tracks\"] .iff-code,.sim-console [data-slot=\"tracks\"] .col-iff,.sim-console [data-slot=\"tracks\"] [data-field=\"iff\"],.sim-console [data-slot=\"tracks\"] [data-col=\"iff\"],.sim-console [data-slot=\"tracks\"] [data-key=\"iff\"],.sim-console [data-slot=\"tracks\"] [headers~=\"iff\"]{display:table-cell!important;visibility:visible!important;width:auto!important;max-width:none!important;color:var(--ink-bright);letter-spacing:.03em}\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"tracks\"] th.iff,.sim-console [data-slot=\"tracks\"] th[data-field=\"iff\"],.sim-console [data-slot=\"tracks\"] th[data-col=\"iff\"]{display:table-cell!important;color:var(--ink-dim)}\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"tracks\"] td:empty::after{content:\"\\2013\";color:var(--ink-dim)}\n\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"resources\"]{flex:1 1 auto;display:block;min-height:0;min-width:0;padding:1px;overflow:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;font-size:9px;line-height:1.2}\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"resources\"] *{font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}\n\n.sim-console .legend{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0}\n.sim-console .lrow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:10px 1fr auto;gap:5px;align-items:center;font-size:9px;padding:0}\n.sim-console .sw{width:9px;height:9px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);border-radius:1px}\n.sim-console .sw.f{background:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 5px rgba(88,166,255,.5)}\n.sim-console .sw.g{background:var(--grn);box-shadow:0 0 5px rgba(111,224,138,.45)}\n.sim-console .sw.n{background:var(--amber);box-shadow:0 0 5px rgba(224,184,58,.45)}\n.sim-console .sw.h{background:var(--red);box-shadow:0 0 5px rgba(224,85,74,.5)}\n.sim-console .lrow b{font-weight:500;color:var(--ink-bright)}\n.sim-console .lrow em{font-style:normal;font-size:7.5px;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--ink-dim);text-transform:uppercase}\n\n.sim-console .footer{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;overflow:hidden}\n.sim-console .decision{flex:0 0 auto}\n.sim-console .decision>.bd{gap:1px;padding:1px 4px 2px}\n.sim-console .seqhint{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;flex-wrap:nowrap;gap:3px;font-size:7.5px;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--ink-dim);text-transform:uppercase;overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap}\n.sim-console .seqhint u{text-decoration:none;border:1px solid var(--edge2);padding:0 4px;border-radius:2px;background:#08130c}\n.sim-console .seqhint u.ammo{border-color:#7a6420;color:#c9b26a}\n/* engagement control: compact type so every control \\u2014 including magazine / reload,\n   if the runtime supplies one \\u2014 fits without an inner scroller */\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"]{display:block;flex:0 0 auto;height:88px;padding:1px;overflow:hidden;font-size:8.5px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:.02em}\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] *{font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit;max-width:100%}\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button,.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] select,.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] input,.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] label,.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] a{font-family:inherit;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.03em;padding:1px 4px;line-height:1.1;min-height:0;min-width:0;border-radius:2px}\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] h1,.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] h2,.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] h3,.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] h4{font-size:8px;margin:0;letter-spacing:.07em}\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] svg{max-height:30px}\n/* FIRE / ENGAGE command: dominant, bold, red \\u2014 whatever hook the runtime gives it */\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button.fire,\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button.engage,\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button.btn-fire,\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button.danger,\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[class*=\"fire\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[class*=\"engage\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[id*=\"fire\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[id*=\"engage\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[name*=\"fire\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[value*=\"fire\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[data-action*=\"fire\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[data-action*=\"engage\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[data-role*=\"fire\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[aria-label*=\"fire\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] [role=\"button\"][class*=\"fire\" i]{font-size:13px!important;font-weight:700!important;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:5px 16px!important;color:#fff2ee!important;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f0685a,#8e1f17)!important;border:1px solid #ff9c90!important;box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(224,85,74,.6),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.28)!important;text-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.65)}\n/* cease fire stays a subdued amber so it cannot be mistaken for the fire command */\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[class*=\"cease\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[id*=\"cease\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[data-action*=\"cease\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[value*=\"cease\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[aria-label*=\"cease\" i]{font-size:8.5px!important;font-weight:600!important;padding:2px 8px!important;color:#f0dca0!important;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#3a2f10,#221a08)!important;border:1px solid #7a6420!important;box-shadow:none!important;text-shadow:none;letter-spacing:.08em}\n/* reload / magazine command, if the runtime provides one: clearly present, clearly not FIRE */\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[class*=\"reload\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[class*=\"rearm\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[class*=\"magazine\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[class*=\"resupply\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[id*=\"reload\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[id*=\"rearm\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[id*=\"magazine\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[data-action*=\"reload\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[data-action*=\"rearm\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[data-action*=\"magazine\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[value*=\"reload\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[aria-label*=\"reload\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"] button[aria-label*=\"rearm\" i]{font-size:9px!important;font-weight:700!important;letter-spacing:.10em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 10px!important;color:#04170a!important;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#8fe6a2,#3f9a58)!important;border:1px solid #b6ffc8!important;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(111,224,138,.35),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.25)!important;text-shadow:none}\n/* the same hooks inside the resources panel, so a magazine control rendered there reads alike */\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"resources\"] button[class*=\"reload\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"resources\"] button[class*=\"rearm\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"resources\"] button[class*=\"magazine\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"resources\"] button[data-action*=\"reload\" i],\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"resources\"] button[data-action*=\"rearm\" i]{font-family:inherit;font-size:9px!important;font-weight:700!important;letter-spacing:.10em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 8px!important;color:#04170a!important;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#8fe6a2,#3f9a58)!important;border:1px solid #b6ffc8!important;border-radius:2px}\n\n.sim-console .keyrow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:6px;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n.sim-console .fkeys{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,minmax(0,1fr));gap:3px}\n.sim-console .fkey{padding:0;text-align:center;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.04em;border:1px solid var(--edge2);border-radius:2px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0e2415,#081209);color:var(--ink-dim);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(120,220,150,.06)}\n.sim-console .fkey.act{color:#04170a;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#8fe6a2,#4fae66);border-color:#8fe6a2}\n.sim-console .fkey.off{color:#27452f;border-color:#152b1b}\n.sim-console .plate{padding:0 10px;border:1px solid #4a3f1e;border-radius:2px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#3a3117,#221c0d);color:#c9b26a;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap}\n\n@media (max-width:1460px){\n.sim-console .main{grid-template-columns:76px minmax(0,1fr) 246px;grid-template-rows:minmax(0,2fr) minmax(0,1fr);grid-template-areas:\"rail scope res\" \"rail picture res\"}\n}\n@media (max-width:1080px){\n.sim-console .main{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 160px;grid-template-rows:minmax(0,2fr) minmax(0,1fr);grid-template-areas:\"scope res\" \"picture res\"}\n.sim-console .rail{display:none}\n}\n@media (max-height:620px){\n.sim-console .footer .keyrow{display:none}\n.sim-console [data-slot=\"decision\"]{height:76px}\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"sim-console\">\n <div class=\"bezel\">\n  <div class=\"screen\">\n\n   <div class=\"topbar\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">\n     <div data-slot=\"system-name\"></div>\n     <div class=\"sub\">Air Defence Operator Console &middot; Fixed 120&deg; Sector</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"statechips\">\n     <div class=\"chip on\">Surveillance</div>\n     <div class=\"chip\">Acquisition</div>\n     <div class=\"chip\">Engaged</div>\n     <div class=\"chip\">Rockets in air 0 / 2</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"clockwrap\">\n     <div class=\"lab\">Mission Clock / TTI</div>\n     <div data-slot=\"clock\"></div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n\n   <div class=\"main\">\n\n    <div class=\"rail\">\n     <div class=\"panel\">\n      <div class=\"hd\">Sensor</div>\n      <div class=\"bd\">\n       <div class=\"grouplab\">Coverage</div>\n       <div class=\"kv\"><span>Sector</span><b>120&deg;</b></div>\n       <div class=\"kv\"><span>Tilt</span><b>+06.0&deg;</b></div>\n       <div class=\"kv\"><span>Limit</span><b>-02/+30</b></div>\n       <div class=\"grouplab\">Detection</div>\n       <div class=\"kv\"><span>Jet</span><b>150 km</b></div>\n       <div class=\"kv\"><span>Helo</span><b>100 km</b></div>\n       <div class=\"kv\"><span>UAV</span><b>50 km</b></div>\n       <div class=\"grouplab\">Engage</div>\n       <div class=\"kv\"><span>Long</span><b>70 km</b></div>\n       <div class=\"kv\"><span>Med</span><b>50 km</b></div>\n       <div class=\"kv\"><span>Short</span><b>20 km</b></div>\n       <div class=\"kv\"><span>Min</span><b>05 km</b></div>\n       <div class=\"kv\"><span>Sim</span><b>2 MAX</b></div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"panel\">\n      <div class=\"hd\">Fire Key</div>\n      <div class=\"bd\">\n       <div class=\"kv\"><span>Ready</span><b>RDY</b></div>\n       <div class=\"kv\"><span>Launch</span><b>LNCH</b></div>\n       <div class=\"kv\"><span>Interc</span><b>INT</b></div>\n       <div class=\"kv\"><span>Miss</span><b>MISS</b></div>\n       <div class=\"kv warn\"><span>Empty</span><b>NO RDS</b></div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"panel scope\">\n     <div class=\"hd\">Situation Display <span class=\"r\">rings 20 / 50 / 70 km &middot; press and drag to move centre</span></div>\n     <div class=\"bd\">\n      <div class=\"rangebar\">\n       <span class=\"zlab\">Range</span>\n       <div data-slot=\"range\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"scopewrap\">\n       <div data-slot=\"scope\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"scopefoot\">\n       <div>SECTOR FIXED 120&deg;</div>\n       <div>PAN: PRESS + DRAG MAP</div>\n       <div>ENVELOPE AUTO</div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"panel picture\">\n     <div class=\"hd\">Track Readout <span class=\"r\">ID + IFF code per track</span></div>\n     <div class=\"bd\">\n      <div data-slot=\"tracks\"></div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"right\">\n     <div class=\"panel\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto\">\n      <div class=\"hd\">Interceptors <span class=\"r\">rounds / magazine</span></div>\n      <div class=\"bd\"><div data-slot=\"resources\"></div></div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"panel\" style=\"flex:0 0 auto\">\n      <div class=\"hd\">Identification Key</div>\n      <div class=\"bd\">\n       <div class=\"legend\">\n        <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"sw f\"></span><b>Our Forces</b><em>call sign</em></div>\n        <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"sw g\"></span><b>Friendly</b><em>friendly</em></div>\n        <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"sw n\"></span><b>Unknown</b><em>unresolved</em></div>\n        <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"sw h\"></span><b>Enemy</b><em>engageable</em></div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n\n   </div>\n\n   <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"panel decision\">\n     <div class=\"hd\">Engagement Control <span class=\"r\">two rockets in the air max &middot; magazine / reload issued here</span></div>\n     <div class=\"bd\">\n      <div class=\"seqhint\"><u>1 select track</u><u>2 target type</u><u>3 classification</u><u>4 interceptor</u><u>5 launcher</u><u>6 review tti / pk</u><u>7 fire / cease fire</u><u class=\"ammo\">rounds low &rarr; reload / magazine</u><u>radar tilt</u></div>\n      <div data-slot=\"decision\"></div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"keyrow\">\n     <div class=\"fkeys\">\n      <div class=\"fkey act\">F1</div><div class=\"fkey\">F2</div><div class=\"fkey\">F3</div><div class=\"fkey\">F4</div><div class=\"fkey\">F5</div><div class=\"fkey\">F6</div><div class=\"fkey\">F7</div><div class=\"fkey\">F8</div><div class=\"fkey\">F9</div><div class=\"fkey\">F10</div><div class=\"fkey\">F11</div><div class=\"fkey off\">F12</div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"plate\">Training Simulation &mdash; Not For Operational Use</div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n\n  </div>\n </div>\n</div>",
    "design_notes": "Unchanged from the reference reading: the dark bezel + inset green CRT screen, hairline #1d4227 panel borders on #0a150e fills, #8ee39a body ink with #c9ffd4 highlights, amber and red accents, the status header, the F1\rand the left rail / big scope / right table+resource split all come from the four screenshots; the track columns, IFF states and the seven-step engagement sequence come from the profile. This revision only addresses request 6: I could not add a reload or magazine-change button, because a control I paint here would be dead \\u2014 there is no slot for it, and the rules forbid unwired chrome. Instead I made room and hooks for a real one: the decision slot is 88px tall (76px on short screens) so the runtime can render a Reload / Magazine control beside FIRE without an inner scroller, and I added CSS hooks so any injected button named reload/rearm/magazine renders as a prominent green command in either the decision or resources slot. Supporting readouts only: the Interceptors panel header now reads \"rounds / magazine\", the fire key legend gained a NO RDS state, and the sequence strip carries an amber \"rounds low \\u2192 reload / magazine\" hint. The runtime must actually emit that control for the operator to be able to rearm.",
